// DEFECT (silent). An `Immunity` with no `Holds when` is accepted and protects no one.
// Expected: it holds for every holder, or `check` says it can never hold.
Fact p Identified by A
Bool done
Act hit Actor p Recipient p' Holds when True Creates done()
Immunity shield Holder p Against hit
.
?valid hit(A, A).        // WRONG: A is shielded
